[00:16.12]1. Because we are imperfect, O Jehovah,
[00:22.84]The inclination of our heart is flawed.
[00:30.72]There is a sin that easily ensnares us—
[00:35.04]A lack of faith in you, the living God.
[00:40.54](Chorus)
[00:46.04]Give us more faith, we beg of you, Jehovah.
[00:54.33]Please help us out according to our need.
[01:02.30]Give us more faith, according to your mercy,
[01:10.14]That we may honor you in word and deed.
[01:35.71]2. Apart from faith, no one can fully please you.
[01:41.95]We must believe our faith will be repaid.
[01:49.92]And as a shield, our faith provides a refuge.
[01:57.92]We face the future firm and unafraid.
[02:01.92](Chorus)
[02:05.92]Give us more faith, we beg of you, Jehovah.
[02:14.11]Please help us out according to our need.
[02:21.95]Give us more faith, according to your mercy,
[02:29.83]That we may honor you in word and deed.